{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0b1a23e4573bb529fd902376a0a2c44ca18c8e4d9c4a0e12b51f6ffd99094a46","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_56926c0e8bf83fb6503bf30c670546b6ae5fa246cee88fbb7e8d3f7183c9c0be","slc_9e746f0e14e1983e1dfb3fd15865b423f526b15efff84a48455f457ef3bc7921"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"Git commit tracking works only with Qdrant; the SQLite-vec schema is hardcoded for code chunks and lacks commit metadata fields such as author, branch, and hash.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0c6632fea12d0debe85a570aaeee56eab1841268050596f955a63652b0828dac","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_37e6d8963f8e6cc3591d539db3f90315097e2a78403ba35468259bef33b2715f","slc_3befe0102f4cdc4a843caea018a3a4f14f8494906df8fd012b942093bedc20b6","slc_3d7427e3fb37be18c9473a096a831d8f80d90b318dbb4beab141f620bc48ae18"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"Each workspace keeps state in .codebase/: state.json for collection and indexing status, cache.json for file hashes, and vectors.db for the SQLite-vec store; legacy files are migrated on first run.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_13ddd0fcefebef76fa624191dd5dd0a77f3b909857a46a684b9df7d9ef683c40","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_704ca93950c9d559a3eaf21c3315807e28ee3d7eb544fb15f317b119df30b992","slc_908476824bb6418839e2cc336f870ca86c029f358591ad28457f6cbb5fcfe8ad"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"When git tracking is enabled, the CLI watches the .git directory, detects commits, pulls, merges and branch changes, extracts metadata and diffs, sends context to an LLM, and indexes the analysis alongside code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3143cc4f0ba3faa7e26380645846b8635e6e7246f5f911b34194c583a8aee05c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_076b8d9f3e6b0f57487f2d66348e5080be44b673c443eaf96fcf906ed33c3989","slc_4076560bdb1761d503dc1b1cb81a24ccf0d6e3238d47fd264117a3ddc72b704b","slc_aa8d84330be6bf1a9f6ebc64f50a06ea020eeda4a2e7e66a0e660f922b0b0fa6","slc_c6875a23bcf4ac259dbeed9a852a7f78ab05ff6f499d129a8ced42007072d1a3","slc_e770ab83ecbd145873133cda0bc3a9892f702050cc624f08182d2da739dae3ae"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"Different embedders can be configured per vector store, with store-specific variables overriding a global fallback, e.g. a cheaper local model for SQLite and a larger one for Qdrant.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4dfa063fa687d3fab228f404db2275ab7816f98071486a29bc41a8143f0f0c55","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b5565c1723d907291894a673602617f611bb1a1349a980bc4c62cd8660c221d4"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"The CLI exposes commands including -start, -restart, -stats, -full-reset, -index-history <count>, and semantic-search with options like --collection, --limit, and --rerank.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8d7f93e45695b85799308466f96f25c399224490bf8c2a9f0fe583add61eed5c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_00735e6f2bb839409013332001446bd76166df40b679df17ed829fb4d8840552","slc_c961223cb7befc5d4bdd3970ef5677a3b313a8a351a3694c162175d8a1c72b43","slc_d58559ff1b542ffeef6815e836f33b094f84784d5ce7e0b963e0a8d1bba27e91"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"Embedding requires an OpenAI-compatible API (OpenAI, compatible endpoints, or Ollama with explicit dimension); Gemini, Anthropic, and non-OpenAI-compatible APIs are not supported.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_97bec9def58c1f1e8ff1c7b6d1ec26227d9a101ec8d4acfa23adbb7744323645","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_87f8758db7b859f14801c655bed6fce35fcd14e02d0de52d1ec2d929cde56a02","slc_e643d2bd7edee982d19af7e6cd9f85395937591329899234f4c89d0885c021f8"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"Qdrant mode requires a running Qdrant server, e.g. via Docker on port 6333, while SQLite-vec mode needs no external services.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ab0aa1a973b0e3bf5d33444190183fc774eb188d5efe2f8286ed55d3f1a7cfbc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3c807e56c8d2899b3bc8fae2c2c57524044b82a5bddeaed78aec6f6a3b04aebe","slc_62092d6e4c008fda06549a1e2add1f1304ec0f0f1a1c3a82c2876fe2460df22b","slc_cc35dbc8c5398ef6e74c00643cf91cfd91c6f6b47854a9402b9ba478b77806d4"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"The semantic-search command can rerank top vector hits with Voyage AI, configured via environment variables with fallbacks, and the rerank step is skipped automatically if no API key is set.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c3435ee9a99bf7ad837357dedad0cefc1df12b0a0d45d9e78a4bfba5a5801b99","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3531b268a08b4738752317fcf0d72c13b50d2f8964dd5089a9084dbfad2071e8"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"The project is described as modular, with an indexer core, workspace watcher, git commit watcher, commit LLM service, vector store implementations, embedders, and tree-sitter parsing modules.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d91fa3b0665c5f4d045afc935607e1f7fb27e1784d888143ea463b159711ef78","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3cea4c0ce2c3a9e2d3ba201135ebe5a542ff8d67720423fd22a555a444d63cd6","slc_8401da75eff0cb4c4c2bb7ff3cc71fc340a0d72e9570e77d702c5b4989ef9440","slc_d5241289c3e0210b661efe387fe4678f60c47ed4a5bda481ac666cd3ca600ccb"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"Installation scripts for macOS and Windows are provided but explicitly untested; only Linux is marked as tested, and the author requests PRs from those who verify them.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e7c72a9d2167f404953f430fe270c292c3f2d1021bd052c7adf6b6db6f970cd8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dudufcb1/codebase-index-cli@8056926534bb snapshot 59d30715023ee86a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_22a1c094a3c13f017662f1a70c2529560c8069099ddffdb5676fd45c6b5b8c89","slc_26c6a80402b53eb8e79643ac37e039bf4ce6c4f37ff8f853eac3f57950b6aa82"],"source_ids":["src_2fa1273f09da5fc292a24e570b67a11a"],"text":"The vector store is selected by the wrapper command used: codesql for local SQLite-vec and codebase for a remote Qdrant server; codebase-index is a legacy compatibility wrapper.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:49:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_304d5d5fb83745acbe0e9e399e984a45"}
